.claude/bee-paths.local.json
.claude/settings.local.json

# Local (personalized) agent context pack. The tracked context/context-pack.md is
# generic and [BRACKETED]; this .local copy holds the user's real identity/details.
# Agents read the .local override if present, else the tracked generic pack.
context/context-pack.local.md

# Kiro hook with employer-specific Taskei config
.kiro/hooks/weekly-status-update-team.kiro.hook
